  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Brann, down at the gang house. And Brann pays nobody without chalking it down first, every sack and every coin, on little slips he keeps in his stash chest. He trusts chalk more than men, that one. Another bowl?
